{"4710580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rocinha Wars", "steam_appid": 4710580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[b]Rocinha Wars[/b] is an online action game where you drop into fast-paced firefights in a dense, vertical urban setting inspired by Brazilian street culture. Player-versus-player pressure is the core: positioning, loadout choices, and split-second decisions decide who walks away from each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Combat and terrain[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is third-person, built around gunplay, cover, and constant map reading. The world shifts in mood with a full day–night cycle, changing visibility and tension. Vehicles let you cross the map faster—or change how you approach a fight and how you escape when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Squad play and risk[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a coordinated squad or on your own initiative: set up flanks and call for support when voice chat is available, or adapt to the chaos when you’re alone in the crossfire. On the map, market opportunities and rewards reward calculated risk—leaving a safe angle can earn you an edge, but it can also expose you to teams lying in wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[b]Characters, locations, and events are fictional[/b] and serve as thematic backdrop; the experience is competitive and cooperative, not a simulation of real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocinha Wars is for players who want intense online matches, who enjoy learning routes and sightlines, and who like repeating runs until they own the pace of the fight.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4710580/extras/8d82908d510ca4c3c845b4f58f6047e3.avif?t=1781706917\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[b]Rocinha Wars[/b] is an online action game 